 "text": "Welcome to Winneshiek County - Winneshiek County Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window You are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser or activate Google Chrome Frame to improve your experience.\nView Agenda\nWatch Meetings\nCalendar\nRoad Closures\nFacebook Search for Search\nToggle navigation\nMENU MENU\nAbout Job Opportunities\nDirectory of Services\nCounty Government\nTourism\nDepartments & Offices Administration, Business & Finance Auditor\nBoard of Supervisors\nTreasurer\nCommunity Services Conservation Board\nLandfill\nRecycling\nVeterans\nCounty Social Services\nGovernment Services Auditor\nRecorder\nPlanning & Zoning\nPublic Safety & Legal Attorney\nEmergency Management\nSheriff\nPublic Health Nursing Service\nRoads Engineer\nReal Estate Assessor\nGIS\nEnvironmental Health & Land Use Environmental Health\nBoards & Commissions\nWelcome to Winneshiek County\nHome to incredible trout fishing, beautiful parks and biking trails, and the famous Decorah eagle nest!\nIn the Spotlight\nPublic Notice\nNotice The Winneshiek County Board of Supervisors is soliciting volunteers to fill vacancies on either the Planning and Zoning Commission … Read More\nORV Renewal\nORV and snowmobile registrations can now be renewed for 2027! Renew before December 31 to avoid a late fee. Read More\nConference on Historical Aspects of Winneshiek County Through 1848\nThe Winneshiek County Historic Preservation Commission (WCHPC) will host a conference on October 17,2026 on the historical aspects of Winneshiek … Read More\nAbout Winneshiek County\nDepartments\nJob Opportunities\nDirectory of Services\nCalendar\nOctober 21, 2026\nWed 21\nCommission of Veterans Affairs Meeting\n10:00 AM - 11:00 AM\nView All Events\nQuick Links\nBoard of Supervisors Current Agenda\nDrivers License Information\nHunting & Fishing License\nJob Opportunities\nLiquor License\nMarriage License\nPassports\nPay Property Tax On-line\nPay Vehicle Registration On-line\nReal Estate Information\nVital Records\nWeapon Permits\nJail Information\nNational Flood Insurance Program\nMinutes & Agenda\nCurrent Agenda\nView Agenda\nLatest Minutes\nOctober 5, 2026\nSeptember 28, 2026\nSeptember 21, 2026\nSeptember 14, 2026\nSeptember 8, 2026\nMinutes Archive\nWatch Meetings\nWinneshiek County, Iowa\n201 W. Main Street | Decorah, Iowa 52101 | (563) 382-5085\nPrivacy Policy",
